        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8241, Grade 1 Low Profile Contemporary Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor the highest degree of security, this Baldwin made deadbolt has a specially designed strike with four security jamb screws and an armored front to conceal the fasteners. A Grade 1 tested, this Contemporary deadbolt has the highest level of security. It is a single cylinder deadbolt meaning that the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a turn bolt by the interior. It has an adjustable backset for doors 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It will fit 2-1/8 inch door cutouts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou'll find the quality, peace of mind and beauty you expect from Baldwin in every lock. A heavy gauge steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts gives this ANSI Grade 1, the highest level security, door lock both strength and durability that is backed by a lifetime limited mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a thumbturn from the interior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available:<br> <a href=\"/products/contemporary-single-cylinder-deadbolt-for-1-5-8-inch-door-preparations-baldwin-8041\"><b>Single Cylinder Contemporary Deadbolt For 1-5/8\" Door Preparations</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-double-cylinder-deadbolt-for-2-1-8-inch-door-preparartions-baldwin-8242\"><b>Double Cylinder Contemporary Deadbolt For 2-1/8\" Door Preparations</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-one-sided-patio-deadbolt-baldwin-8241-pat\"><b>One Sided Contemporary Deadbolt</b></a></p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8241 Contemporary Single Cylinder Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1:  Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" diameter cutouts</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional: STD 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" or THK 2\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Single Cylinder Deadbolt For 2-1/8 Inch Door Preprations, Baldwin 8241",
                "description": "Baldwin 8241 Single Cylinder Contemporary Deadbolt - For the highest degree of security, this Baldwin made deadbolt has a specially designed strike with four security jamb screws and an armored front to conceal the fasteners. A Grade 1 tested, this Contemporary deadbolt has the highest level of security. It is a single cylinder deadbolt meaning that the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a turn bolt by the interior. It has an adjustable backset for doors 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It will fit 2-1/8 inch door cutouts on 1-3/4 inch thick doors.",
                "keywords": "BAL-8241, Baldwin 8241, baldwin contemporary deadbolts, baldwin single cylindger deadbolts, grade 1 deadbolts, steel deadbolts, contemporary door locks, baldwin door locks, baldwin images collections, 2-1/8 door thickness deadbolts,"
